  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VeEQ2N0\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_56694573-3efa-443a-8633-442df914dc86.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_a3275c3a-969a-4088-a2c5-53d65a37be07.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_54901d94-6ad2-4408-869f-27ba9026b292.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_b33feea2-9c55-4bae-9b5d-fff3e2ac52db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky/raw/refs/heads/main/presskit.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_c784751f-c531-4487-994e-5049e59f02d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>欢迎来到&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 10: To the Sky</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ATM10 与经典空岛挑战的终极融合！仅凭一棵树、一个方块和触手可及的庞大模组宇宙，直面虚空挑战。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>性能提示：</strong>为确保最佳性能，请至少分配 <strong>6&ndash;8 GB 内存</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>多人游戏支持：</strong>完全兼容服务器和局域网联机。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任务可选：</strong>可跟随指引循序渐进，亦可开辟属于自己的道路。<br><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LCvCpUhfL2A?si=3FpBxJL1qXK9pgST\" width=\"360\" height=\"216\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hh7aLmgwyMc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"217\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TzgaPq6XY6k\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YvkYIdQNoJU\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>All the Mods 10</strong> 以其海量高质量且深度整合的模组而闻名，如今它已焕然一新，以空岛形式呈现！从微末起步，利用现代自动化、魔法、科技与探索在天空中建立你的帝国，在虚无边缘顽强生存。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_f0f52e24-87e6-4993-bd25-9abce9997875.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"175\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特别感谢 Howester84 为制作本整合包最受欢迎的两座岛屿所付出的努力！他还提供了一些额外的建筑图纸，并在他的 Discord 上分享了许多精彩内容，快去 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/r6V28h8grJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 支持他吧</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>此版本将 ATM10 强大的世界观转化为基于进度推进的空岛挑战，要求你发挥创意并高效自动化以解锁终局内容。<br><br>本次最大的变化是我们现在使用 <strong>NeoForge</strong>&nbsp;并且基于 <strong>1.21</strong> 版本。随着模组陆续发布，敬请期待大量更新！&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 <strong>All the Mods 10 To The Sky</strong>&nbsp;中，我们将延续传统，在增加众多新模组的同时进一步提升稳定性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>“All the Mods”真的包含&nbsp;</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>模组吗？当然不。</strong></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
